    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=\\frac{3}{2}$. Using base $2$, equate the indices: $3x-3=6-3x$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2^{3x-3}&=(2^3)^{2-x}\\\\2^{3x-3}&=2^{6-3x}\\\\3x-3&=6-3x\\\\6x&=9\\\\x&=\\frac{3}{2}\\end{align*}$$",
